### Usage Examples
```markdown
## Usage Examples

### Basic Usage
```php
$example = new Example();
$result = $example->method('test');
```

### Advanced Usage
```php
$config = [
    'option1' => 'value1',
    'option2' => 'value2'
];

$example = new Example($config);
$result = $example->advancedMethod();
```

### Integration Example
```php
use Example\Integration;

$integration = new Integration();
$integration->connect()
    ->process()
    ->complete();
```
```

